# pnpm config — Vite dev workflow
# platform/web/ uses zero npm deps at runtime; the only reason to install
# anything is the dev-only Vite proxy (see vite.config.js). pnpm 12+
# requires explicit opt-in to native post-install scripts (esbuild +
# @parcel/watcher compile a .node binary for the host arch).
onlyBuiltDependencies[]=esbuild
onlyBuiltDependencies[]=@parcel/watcher
